[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-two-knights-d4 4...e6"]
[Name "Two Knights: 4.d4 e6 5.e5"]

5. e5 c5 { The Advance plan, and it comes with extra force here: the knight on c3 has taken the c-pawn's square, so d4 cannot be held by a pawn. [%cal Gc5d4] [%idea attack-the-base] }
6. Be2 Bxf3 { Takes the knight that guards d4. }
7. Bxf3 cxd4 { Takes the pawn. The queen has to take back, and ...Nc6 then hits her with e5 hanging as well. Black is clearly better. } *
